          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"mbr-section article content11\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized Counters\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Square Counters\" name=\"squareCounters\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Counter Color\" name=\"counterColor\" value=\"#149dcc\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#f9f9f9\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters> \n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"mbr-text counter-container col-12 col-md-8 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                <ol>\n                    <li>To foster closer collaboration among researchers across departments that leverage big&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">data to solve real world problems in different application sectors and technical areas.</span></li><li>To provide not only equipment but also research support to PolyU researchers by a&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">multidisciplinary team.</span></li><li>To develop software and tools for collecting, processing, and analyzing big datasets&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">with easy access and management.</span></li><li>To use the facility for education and training of staff, students and professionals in the&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">cutting edge technology and applications of big data analytics.</span></li><li>To build up capabilities in data transfer, analysis and applications which will allow&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">future use of scalable cross institutional and national research facilities.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">To use the facility as a platform to establish strong partnership with Hong Kong&nbsp;</span>companies and industries that may leverage big data computing and analytics to solve complex problems.</li>\n                </ol><div><br></div><div><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">&nbsp;</b></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
