                          </div>\n                            <div class=\"card-text\">\n                                <h4 class=\"mbr-content-title mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitles\"></h4>\n                                <p class=\"mbr-content-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-content-text\">A framework including models, procedures and workflow of big data processing and analytics will be developed and standard analytics tools and libraries will be developed / purchased or adopted from open sources.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card px-3 align-left col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>1\">\n                        <div class=\"panel-item p-3\">\n                            <div class=\"card-img pb-3\">\n                                <span mbr-icon mbr-if=\"showIcons\" class=\"mbri-extension mbr-iconfont pr-2\"></span>\n                                <h3 class=\"count py-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".count\">\n                                    200\n                                </h3>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"card-text\">\n                                <h4 class=\"mbr-content-title mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitles\">\n                                    Trendy websites blocks\n                                </h4>\n                                <p class=\"mbr-content-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-content-text\">\n                                    Choose from the large selection of latest pre-made blocks.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card px-3 align-left col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>2\">\n                        <div class=\"panel-item p-3\">\n                            <div class=\"card-img pb-3\">\n                                <span mbr-icon mbr-if=\"showIcons\" class=\"mbri-responsive mbr-iconfont pr-2\"></span>\n                                <h3 class=\"count py-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".count\">\n                                    300\n                                </h3>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"card-text\">\n                                <h4 class=\"mbr-content-title mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitles\">\n                                    Bootstrap\n                                </h4>\n                                <p class=\"mbr-content-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-content-text\">\n                                        One of Bootstrap's big point is responsiveness \n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card px-3 align-left col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>3\">\n                        <div class=\"panel-item p-3\">\n                            <div class=\"card-img pb-3\">\n                                <span mbr-icon mbr-if=\"showIcons\" class=\"mbri-globe-2 mbr-iconfont pr-2\"></span>\n                                <h3 class=\"count py-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".count\">\n                                    400\n                                </h3>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"card-texts\">\n                                <h4 class=\"mbr-content-title mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitles\">\n                                    Web fonts\n                                </h4>\n                                <p class=\"mbr-content-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-content-text\">\n                                        Mobirise make it easy for you to use Google fonts on your website easily and freely.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
